//   Version: 2.9
//   Purpose: Parsing G1T texture containers
//  Category: Image
// File Mask: *.g1t
//  ID Bytes:
//   History:
//   2.9    2026-08-05  HearHellacopters: Documented the header/attribute/offset table layout confirmed on samples, and what ktgl::CDX11GraphicsDevice::ReadG1THeader actually reads. Parsing unchanged.
//   2.8    2026-08-05  HearHellacopters: Fixed undefined identifiers left from the KTGL_PLATFORM enum rename (TEX_ENUMS, PLATFORM, NSwitch, PS4, PS5) and guarded EX_SWIZZLE access
//   2.7    2026-02-08  HearHellacopters: Added code names to system enum
